      "body": "🔧 FIX: Bump guessit-js 1.0.1 → ^4.0.0 (v1.0.1 unpublished from npm registry)\n\nCI builds for v1.8.10 failed with:\n  npm error 404 Not Found - GET https://registry.npmjs.org/guessit-js/-/guessit-js-1.0.1.tgz\n\nguessit-js@1.0.1 has been unpublished from npm. The package now starts at 3.8.1\nwith 4.0.0 as latest (same publisher: opensubtitles). Earlier builds worked off\nGitHub Actions' cache; fresh `npm ci` can no longer fetch v1.0.1.\n\nAPI surface in src/services/offlineGuessItService.js (`import { guessit }`,\n`guessit(filename)`, `guessit(filename, options)`) is unchanged between 1.x and\n4.x. Verified end-to-end locally:\n  - npm test → 197/197 pass\n  - OfflineGuessItService.guessFromFilename('The.Man.In.The.High.Castle.S01E01.1080p.mkv')\n    → {title: 'The Man In The High Castle', season: 1, episode: 1}\n  - npm run build → clean vite build",
